  "releaseNotes": "# [v0.7.0](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/compare/1738431acb7705d73169caadfd3efaafb6547a61...457a4e6f02cdab56872bfea9dec3e540e584c1d4) (2026-02-06)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **auth:** add OpenAPI compatible authorization handler for security requirements ([4fc34ba](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/4fc34ba65a1008a03f698faf98e82aef03fcf85a))\n* **auth:** authentication should fail if no auth schemes succeeds with authenticating ([a7ced34](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/a7ced34fd20a12478a43868e6b2d8cdd58e0a228))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **auth:** add auth policies to operations ([a076f15](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/a076f1503c69b4a292af8fcde69b48099dc82b67))\n* **auth:** add security scheme options for configuring scope claim and format ([17525a7](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/17525a76938866675f40939f8a3272c9e96afcc5))\n* **auth:** add support for api key parameter resolution ([836cbc8](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/836cbc82ec4597d5fa155697a199815c107edce6))\n* **auth:** include scope validation ([eae28c2](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/eae28c2c3eca6c54093043215b625baeeaee8168))\n* generate security schemes ([7aaff8a](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/7aaff8a3ab989109fcb5182266689521c85464e3))",
